1. Overview
This document details the technical architecture and design specifications of a Low-Code/No-Code AI Orchestration Platform developed for enterprise-grade financial operations, including commercial lending, compliance automation, and AI-driven decision support.
Unlike single-purpose AI solutions or chat-based copilots, this platform functions as a modular orchestration engine capable of safely executing configurable, multi-step AI workflows across departments — all while maintaining audit-grade traceability, model transparency, and vendor independence.
It is engineered for:
	•	Governed scalability: every workflow is policy-bound, traceable, and explainable.  
	•	Adaptability: business logic evolves through YAML configuration, not code refactoring.  
	•	Sustainability: multi-cloud, multi-model architecture prevents vendor lock-in and model churn.  



