7. Scalability & Multi-Cloud Strategy
	•	Horizontal Scaling: Orchestrator and invokers deploy as containerized microservices (AKS or ECS).  
	•	Vertical Scaling: Compute scaling tied to model inference cost per provider.  
	•	Multi-Cloud Abstraction: Each adapter implements provider-specific credentials and endpoints.  
	•	Failover: Registry reroutes traffic if Azure or AML becomes unavailable.  
Business Impact:
The design ensures continuity of operations under vendor outages, regulatory updates, or model deprecations — critical for lending and compliance workflows.



